# This app is a dynamic Node/Passenger service (session-gated, live DB reads on
# every request) — LiteSpeed's page cache must never serve a stale response for
# it. Without this, LSCache can keep serving an old build's output after a
# `git pull` + `npm run build` + Passenger restart, making deploys look like
# they didn't take effect.
<IfModule LiteSpeed>
  CacheDisable public /
</IfModule>
